      "snippet": "几乎是第二名到第五名的总和"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s6",
      "char_len": 4,
      "snippet": "哎说到这"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s7",
      "char_len": 12,
      "snippet": "你应该已经猜出来它是谁了"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s8",
      "char_len": 2,
      "snippet": "就是"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s9",
      "char_len": 7,
      "snippet": "小Lin奶茶店"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s10",
      "char_len": 11,
      "snippet": "不不不咱没有那么厉害啊"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s11",
      "char_len": 5,
      "snippet": "是蜜雪冰城"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s12",
      "char_len": 10,
      "snippet": "你看啊这是2023年"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s13",
      "char_len": 16,
      "snippet": "全球连锁餐饮品牌门店数量的排行榜"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s14",
      "char_len": 14,
      "snippet": "蜜雪冰城超过了36,000家"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s15",
      "char_len": 5,
      "snippet": "前几名里头"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s16",
      "char_len": 15,
      "snippet": "至少都是那种50多年的老品牌了"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s17",
      "char_len": 16,
      "snippet": "而蜜雪真正起来也就是近十来年的事"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s18",
      "char_len": 13,
      "snippet": "而且它依然保持着强劲的增长"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s19",
      "char_len": 13,
      "snippet": "你比如说它那个招牌的柠檬水"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s20",
      "char_len": 9,
      "snippet": "一年能卖出10亿杯"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s21",
      "char_len": 13,
      "snippet": "想当年香飘飘著名的广告语说"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s22",
      "char_len": 5,
      "snippet": "一年7亿杯"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s23",
      "char_len": 6,
      "snippet": "能绕地球两圈"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s24",
      "char_len": 12,
      "snippet": "蜜雪2023年前三个季度"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s25",
      "char_len": 9,
      "snippet": "出货量就58亿杯了"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s26",
      "char_len": 15,
      "snippet": "这都不知道能绕地球多少圈了是吧"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s27",
      "char_len": 3,
      "snippet": "你看啊"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s28",
      "char_len": 15,
      "snippet": "现在火爆的茶饮品牌那是数不胜数"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s29",
      "char_len": 15,
      "snippet": "喜茶奈雪古茗茶百道霸王茶姬对吧"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s30",
      "char_len": 12,
      "snippet": "非常多但是他们是有区别的"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s31",
      "char_len": 4,
      "snippet": "最主要的"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s32",
      "char_len": 12,
      "snippet": "就是各自都有自己的价格带"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s33",
      "char_len": 4,
      "snippet": "而蜜雪呢"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s34",
      "char_len": 16,
      "snippet": "它一直深耕的都是10元以下的市场"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s35",
      "char_len": 7,
      "snippet": "毫不夸张的说哈"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s36",
      "char_len": 13,
      "snippet": "在这个价格带是独一档的存在"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s37",
      "char_len": 9,
      "snippet": "其实吧你看高价市场"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s38",
      "char_len": 7,
      "snippet": "它可能玩法很多"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s39",
      "char_len": 10,
      "snippet": "但是越到平价的市场呢"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s40",
      "char_len": 14,
      "snippet": "它其实是越需要商业能力的支撑"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s41",
      "char_len": 1,
      "snippet": "哎"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s42",
      "char_len": 15,
      "snippet": "咱们就来剖析一下它这个商业秘密"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s43",
      "char_len": 12,
      "snippet": "蜜雪冰城的创始人叫张红超"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s44",
      "char_len": 9,
      "snippet": "小时候家境比较贫寒"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s45",
      "char_len": 5,
      "snippet": "初中刚毕业"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s46",
      "char_len": 12,
      "snippet": "就干了不少那种谋出路的活"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s47",
      "char_len": 15,
      "snippet": "什么修摩托 卖食品 养殖都干过"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s48",
      "char_len": 13,
      "snippet": "后来到河南财经政法大学读书"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s49",
      "char_len": 7,
      "snippet": "还在上学的时候"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s50",
      "char_len": 17,
      "snippet": "1997年就开始了自己的第一次创业"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s266",
      "char_len": 16,
      "snippet": "它是一个披着奶茶外衣的供应链公司"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s267",
      "char_len": 5,
      "snippet": "哎这一点啊"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s268",
      "char_len": 13,
      "snippet": "从它的财务数据上也非常明显"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s269",
      "char_len": 15,
      "snippet": "比如你看这个是蜜雪的招股说明书"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s270",
      "char_len": 17,
      "snippet": "2023年前三季度收入是150多亿"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s271",
      "char_len": 5,
      "snippet": "其中98%"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s272",
      "char_len": 6,
      "snippet": "主要都来源于"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s273",
      "char_len": 12,
      "snippet": "向加盟商的商品和设备销售"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s274",
      "char_len": 15,
      "snippet": "加盟费和相关的服务只占1.8%"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s275",
      "char_len": 7,
      "snippet": "所以你看到没有"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s276",
      "char_len": 17,
      "snippet": "它根本不是一个ToC的卖奶茶的公司"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s277",
      "char_len": 3,
      "snippet": "基本上"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s278",
      "char_len": 16,
      "snippet": "就是一个纯纯的ToB的供应链公司"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s279",
      "char_len": 15,
      "snippet": "好像更像是一个奶茶行业的卖铲人"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s280",
      "char_len": 9,
      "snippet": "而卖铲人这个角色哈"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s281",
      "char_len": 11,
      "snippet": "给蜜雪又带来了一个好处"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s282",
      "char_len": 13,
      "snippet": "这也是它供应链的第三个好处"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s283",
      "char_len": 10,
      "snippet": "就是帮助蜜雪降低风险"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s284",
      "char_len": 6,
      "snippet": "这个怎么讲呢"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s285",
      "char_len": 11,
      "snippet": "你比如说蜜雪的尤力克柠"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s286",
      "char_len": 15,
      "snippet": "它现在也会供应给其他的奶茶品牌"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s287",
      "char_len": 13,
      "snippet": "这个奶茶品牌可以一茬一茬的"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s288",
      "char_len": 4,
      "snippet": "常换常新"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s289",
      "char_len": 12,
      "snippet": "但如果我作为供应链的上游"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s290",
      "char_len": 8,
      "snippet": "我就是个卖柠檬的"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s291",
      "char_len": 17,
      "snippet": "那只要柠檬茶 柠檬水这个市场在增长"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s292",
      "char_len": 9,
      "snippet": "不管奶茶品牌怎么样"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s293",
      "char_len": 5,
      "snippet": "我就在增长"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s294",
      "char_len": 13,
      "snippet": "就好像新能源汽车的品牌对吧"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s295",
      "char_len": 7,
      "snippet": "来一波走一波的"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s296",
      "char_len": 11,
      "snippet": "但如果我是个卖锂电池的"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s297",
      "char_len": 13,
      "snippet": "只要整体新能源的市场在增长"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s298",
      "char_len": 6,
      "snippet": "那我就在增长"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s299",
      "char_len": 3,
      "snippet": "而不会"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s300",
      "char_len": 14,
      "snippet": "受某几个新能源汽车品牌的影响"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s301",
      "char_len": 5,
      "snippet": "所以你看啊"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s302",
      "char_len": 10,
      "snippet": "它越往供应链的上游走"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s303",
      "char_len": 12,
      "snippet": "它其实抗风险能力是越强的"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s304",
      "char_len": 11,
      "snippet": "也可以帮它去尽量的避开"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s305",
      "char_len": 10,
      "snippet": "奶茶可以说是红海市场"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s542",
      "char_len": 15,
      "snippet": "通过雪王这个IP跟用户产生连接"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s543",
      "char_len": 8,
      "snippet": "去建立用户的心智"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s544",
      "char_len": 12,
      "snippet": "你看啊经过咱们这么一分析"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s545",
      "char_len": 7,
      "snippet": "蜜雪冰城乍一看"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s546",
      "char_len": 13,
      "snippet": "好像是个连锁的现制茶饮公司"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s547",
      "char_len": 4,
      "snippet": "仔细一看"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s548",
      "char_len": 3,
      "snippet": "发现哎"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s549",
      "char_len": 9,
      "snippet": "原来是个供应链公司"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s550",
      "char_len": 13,
      "snippet": "现在又要拓展成一个文化公司"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s551",
      "char_len": 6,
      "snippet": "你是不是感觉"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s552",
      "char_len": 12,
      "snippet": "奶茶行业的门道还是挺深的"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s553",
      "char_len": 3,
      "snippet": "虽说哈"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s554",
      "char_len": 13,
      "snippet": "蜜雪冰城它从门店的数量来看"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s555",
      "char_len": 8,
      "snippet": "已经紧逼星巴克了"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s556",
      "char_len": 14,
      "snippet": "但是从营收全球化的程度来看呢"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s557",
      "char_len": 11,
      "snippet": "它肯定还有很长的路要走"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s558",
      "char_len": 13,
      "snippet": "要成为一家标杆性的茶饮品牌"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s559",
      "char_len": 7,
      "snippet": "它也有很多挑战"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s560",
      "char_len": 3,
      "snippet": "比如说"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s561",
      "char_len": 16,
      "snippet": "它现在主要拓展的还都是发展中国家"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s562",
      "char_len": 13,
      "snippet": "未来发达国家它能不能打进去"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s563",
      "char_len": 13,
      "snippet": "这个性价比的路线能不能走通"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s564",
      "char_len": 11,
      "snippet": "和加盟商合作的这个模式"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s565",
      "char_len": 6,
      "snippet": "需不需要调整"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s566",
      "char_len": 6,
      "snippet": "包括现在这个"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s567",
      "char_len": 16,
      "snippet": "IP战略从长期看效果到底会怎么样"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s568",
      "char_len": 4,
      "snippet": "这些问题"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s569",
      "char_len": 13,
      "snippet": "就交给蜜雪冰城自己去思考吧"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "s570",
      "char_len": 9,
      "snippet": "我得赶紧去筹划一下"
    },
    {
